    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0038_08100b77895c.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 211px;\" /><br />Let <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&amp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>∵</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br />then,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn></math>"
